@startuml pattern-observer
!include style.iuml
' Observer: everything that must happen when an incident changes is a listener.
' The hidden links only arrange the five listeners in two rows.

set separator none
hide empty members
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 36

class IncidentService <<service>> {
  + report(…) : Incident
  + changeStatus(…)
}

class IncidentEvent <<record>> {
  incident, actor, action
  oldStatus, newStatus, note
}

class IncidentEventPublisher {
  + publish(event)
}

interface IncidentEventListener {
  + onIncidentEvent(event)
}

class AuditTrailListener
class NotificationListener
class LiveUpdateListener
class CategoryClassifier
class WebhookListener

IncidentService --> IncidentEventPublisher : publish
IncidentEventPublisher .right.> IncidentEvent
IncidentEventPublisher o-- "*" IncidentEventListener : listeners
IncidentEventListener <|.. AuditTrailListener
IncidentEventListener <|.. NotificationListener
IncidentEventListener <|.. LiveUpdateListener
IncidentEventListener <|.. CategoryClassifier
IncidentEventListener <|.. WebhookListener
AuditTrailListener -[hidden]down- CategoryClassifier
NotificationListener -[hidden]down- WebhookListener
@enduml
